body-treated probes was shown by agarose gel electrophoresis (<xref ref-type="other" rid="sup1">Supplementary Figure S1</xref>).</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn5"><label>d</label><p>Nc: no change.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>